        "text": "top of page\nDonate\nDISTRICT 2 - VOICE OF CHANGE\n# Monthanus Ratanapakdee\nIndependent leadership for a safer, cleaner, stronger San Francisco.\nA mother, neighbor, and community advocate with more than 30 years in San Francisco running to deliver common-sense solutions, dignity, and accountability at City Hall.\nI am running for District 2 Supervisor to keep our streets safe,support small businesses, and keep our neighborhoods clean and welcoming. No big money. No party machine just door knocking, conversations, and community.\n​\nDistrict 2 deserves an independent voice.\n​​\nDonate\nGet Email Updates\n## VOICE OF CHANGE\nMeet Monthanus\nMonthanus Ratanapakdee is a mother, neighbor, and longtime San Franciscan.\nAfter losing her father, Vicha, in a tragic act of violence, she stepped forward to serve her community.\nShe is running for District 2 Supervisor to make our neighborhoods safer, cleaner, and more responsive for every family.\nREAD MORE\n## STAY UPDATED\n## Join our campaign for a safer and stronger District 2.\n# EXPERIENCE\n# • 30+ years in San Francisco • Mother\n• Community advocate\n# FOCUS\n# Independent, people-powered leadership\nAccountability at City Hall\n# CAMPAIGN\n# • Public safety • Clean streets\n• Local businesses • Families\nbottom of page",
